From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 03:23:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Verify students by IIUI Registration Number format instead of
 roster

Students can now be verified without a pre-uploaded roster:
- Registration Number must match the IIUI pattern (alphanumeric parts
  joined by "/" or "-", e.g. 002136/MSDS/S24 or 4001-FBAS)
- Email must be a valid address
- Duplicate submissions (same Registration Number) still blocked
- If a roster IS later uploaded, matching email is still enforced for
  any listed Registration Number

Updated student placeholder/example and verification help text (EN/AR)
to show the real 002136/MSDS/S24 format, and added clear format/email
error messages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
